# ── Never commit credentials ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code keeps its OAuth token here, and ~/.claude.json holds MCP server
# secrets (Firecrawl API key, Discord bot token). Only the declarative config
# files under .claude/ are tracked: settings.json, CLAUDE.md, RTK.md.
.claude/.credentials.json
.claude.json
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/history.jsonl
.claude/statsig/
.claude/file-history/
.claude/plugins/
.claude/ide/
.claude/hooks/
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# ── Runtime state, caches, sockets ────────────────────────────────────────────
.config/herdr/*.log
.config/herdr/*.sock
.config/herdr/session.json
.config/herdr/release-notes.json
.config/herdr/.plugins.lock
.config/zen/*/
.config/google-chrome/
*.log
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.pkg.tar.zst
